{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QDilogarithm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QDilogarithm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.pentagon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.pentagon","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm.lean#L48-L48","doc":"**Pentagon identity** (5-term relation):\nLi₂_q(y) + Li₂_q(x) = Li₂_q(xy) +\n  Li₂_q(x(1-y)/(1-xy)) + Li₂_q(y(1-x)/(1-xy)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.div","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.div","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Division: (x,y) ↦ x/y (requires y invertible). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.compl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.compl","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Complement: x ↦ 1 - x. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.mul","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Binary composition for pentagon arguments: (x,y) ↦ xy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.Li2_eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","na